\ S13 probe F1 — one type var used both bare and App-headed in one signature.
\ Decides whether a callee head var could ever need Image::Concrete: if the
\ checker rejects this declaration, CallerVar is the only possible head image.
import: intrinsics * ;

: w ['F 'T] ( 'F -- 'F['T] ) ;
: main ( -- ) ;
